r raspberry mousse. </text><label /><audioURL>learning_objects/assets/8326.mp3</audioURL><skipPrefix>false</skipPrefix><isExample>false</isExample><modelAnswerString>If you &lt;b&gt;enjoyed&lt;/b&gt; Suzanne's chocolate cake, then I'm sure you'll love her raspberry mousse. </modelAnswerString></question><question ignorePunctuation="false" ignoreCase="false"><ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun>false</ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun><ignorePunctuationWithExceptions>false</ignorePunctuationWithExceptions><text>If the company [were to insist] on me moving to Alaska, I would resign. </text><label /><audioURL>learning_objects/assets/8327.mp3</audioURL><skipPrefix>false</skipPrefix><isExample>false</isExample><modelAnswerString>If the company &lt;b&gt;were to insist&lt;/b&gt; on me moving to Alaska, I would resign. </modelAnswerString></question><question ignorePunctuation="false" ignoreCase="false"><ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun>false</ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun><ignorePunctuationWithExceptions>false</ignorePunctuationWithExceptions><text>If you [were to write] an autobiography, what would its title be?</text><label /><audioURL>learning_objects/assets/8328.mp3</audioURL><skipPrefix>false</skipPrefix><isExample>false</isExample><modelAnswerString>If you &lt;b&gt;were to write&lt;/b&gt; an autobiography, what would its title be?</modelAnswerString></question><question ignorePunctuation="false" ignoreCase="false"><ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun>false</ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun><ignorePunctuationWithExceptions>false</ignorePunctuationWithExceptions><text>If you [knew] Marcus better, you'd realise there's no point in asking him to lend you money. </text><label /><audioURL>learning_objects/assets/8329.mp3</audioURL><skipPrefix>false</skipPrefix><isExample>false</isExample><modelAnswerString>If you &lt;b&gt;knew&lt;/b&gt; Marcus better, you'd realise there's no point in asking him to lend you money. </modelAnswerString></question><question ignorePunctuation="false" ignoreCase="false"><ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun